sequenceDiagram
    actor Tester
    participant Builder as IVR flow builder
    participant FF as AudioTranscoder (ffmpeg)
    participant Store as flow-audio storage
    participant DB as Database
    participant Phone as Browser phone
    participant Engine as ConversationEngine
    Tester->>Builder: 1. pick the audio language, upload a recording on a step
    Builder->>FF: 2. convert to MP3 (browser) and 8 kHz WAV (IVR)
    FF->>Store: 3. flow-audio/sha1.mp3 and .wav, never overwritten
    Builder->>DB: 4. save the recording on the draft's clip
    Tester->>Phone: 5. Test draft on, place a call
    Phone->>Engine: 6. start call with use_draft
    Engine->>DB: 7. run the draft's steps
    Tester->>Builder: 8. Publish
    Builder->>DB: 9. check problems, archive the live version, draft becomes live
    Builder->>DB: 10. copy it into a new draft, sharing audio files
    Phone->>Engine: 11. new calls run the published version
